{
  "id": "JHN.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 11",
  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Lasaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi gwanda siisi miyaan siguura Lasaro bea ng'eanyiida Betaniya, nea gharang'da geaba Mariya gil ea huda ghaamwat siguura Marta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mariyaheani diita ghayi easha Ng'utamiida nagheeda ng'andit ama ng'ata goobuus geeshanga aba buudeagaaschiin gil, nea abeeda ghamnyaan orjeeda ghaamwat siguura Lasaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeaksa Haweega ghaamwat nea geeyeesha, “Ng'utamiida, siida ibwariinyi ghamnyaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Yesu ng'asheanji gwayeesha, “Geeyooni maygweadu miyeeda, gaba giigheambiita ASEETA, miyeanji geebaysiina gideaba abeeda gajeakghaambiit Orjeeda ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abeeda ghabwariiy Marta ea huda ghaamwat ea Lasaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwanyas Yesu iita gideaba ghamnyaan, goopteada aba hoowa ea ghang'ata eawooji iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata ng'asheesu gwayeesha ginealangaaschi, “Eaniyean eebiikta eeweaya Yudeya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoanyaash giinealanga nea geeyeesha, “Rabi, miigageawiit damanda gasseewa fuga Yahudi gaftaneey lagheanga ak ghamneawa gigasayi biikta gicha hoowa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Heapi roobuutka aseeta aba jeeda askwearda mii damaniyeenya? Asi siida iiweelweel askweari ea moamu ghwalas geeshta gil aba gideaba ghwadaah weeshinda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuku siida iiweelweel eawa ghoamu ghwalas geeshta gil aba gideaba manda jeadaanyi weeshinda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoahiit Yesu rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu gwayeesha saawa, “Siida siduupcheewi was Lasaro nilil, ak gaydawa daheat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda giinealanga ak gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida iibeachi ruweanga, gayghahaap.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yesu gabaloola iita miyeadaanyi, ak ghaghay saawa gili baloola iita ruweanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Yesu nea ghoadaajiit, “Lasaro nimi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghamneawa geahoosanyi aba badahuukeagwa ak ea nighaas heeta ea meandani hoowa ak abeeda ghoamwaschi. Asi eeweaya headaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Domasoyda siguura Saleaygweanda giinealanga suurja, “Apkaani eeweaya ak geemeewuudayeewi niny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu duunooda gil ea eaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda hitaawa Yesu hoowa abeeda Lasaro niibiida jeesigeeda eawooji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Betaniya ea neekeewa Yerusalemu maygwaduulu aseadeanagi hiteayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda ea nupka fuga saang'a bea Yahudi heeda Marta ea Mariya eegeandeawa salgheang'da aba miyeeda orjeeda ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iiy Marta gideaba ghwaan Yesu gawa roonyeeda nea Mariya geanung'wa ghoah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Marta Yesu, “Ng'utamiida inyeeda heeta gindi hiji ghwanyawa orjeeda giyeanya gajea miighami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ghamneawa ghaanali gideaba iimusi ASEETA gida wassean gaygagoonyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Orjeeda geamadu gaygwaduudu gicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Marta niny, “Ghaanali gideaba gaygwaduudu gicha eaweeda jea gwaduutuuna buuneeda eaweeda huuydean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu ak gwayeesha niny, “Aniini geawooschi duunooda ea eaweega; siida iimwasan eara ghami gajea majeek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida majeek ak ghamwasan ea mayghami earahay. Ghamneawa gumwasi ng'asheanji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Huumwa gil Ng'utamiida; aniini ghaamwaashchi gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi Gristo, Orjeeda ASEETA, jea ghwahidu jeeda ng'eanyiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gooyeawda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheanji, gawa ak gaguursa huda ghaamwat siguura Mariya, ak gameang'sheesa nea gwayeesha, “Nukwa Giinealshoocheanda gwanda hiji nea gaguuru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy ng'asheanji gootkweal ak gawa headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yesu mii ghwahidu gharang'dida, gudugwanda heeda ghwanyawa deepteaysa Marta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean dea fuga Yahudi ghwanyawa mideayi aba jeeda gheeda nea gageanda salgheang'da, gidang'eata ak gidalamwajaadayda Mariya nea gwarita jarooda, ghwaat geeshta, nea ghaghay gili weah heeda bung'eeda gooyeawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita Mariya heeda mida Yesu ghwadaah ak gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida, heeta inyeeda gindi hiji orjeediyya gajea mii ghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Yesu gidayeawudeayda nea eara fuga Yahudi ghwanyawa adeana earaga gooyeawda ghang'ut giiseaneega nea gwasawana gurooroadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ghoayiinyi yeenu siida?” Geeyeesha niny, “Ng'utamiida beeni daaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooyeawda Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi fuga Yahudi, “Adaaha gidabwariiyda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gwayi mwaatkwa aba jeenyaawa, “Asiisi ghayi jaat gheanyanga siida ng'oawiin ghwaraay ghwanung' ea mwami siisi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lasaro geetuudu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nigiisan Yesu aba jeadaanyi ghwahita heeda bung'eeda; abeeda bung'eeni gwaleeda nea geedukuteawa lagheaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Ageanda lagheaneeda.” Ghwasha Martayda was huda gheamata siida heeta meahiin ak gwayeesha niny, “Ng'utamiida, gajea niimealu aba gideaba nih eaweedeaba ang'wani aba miyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Heapi miidarukuneeyi gideaba iimwasi gaydaaha giigheambiita ASEETA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geegeanda lagheaneedida. Ng'ata goong'weersa Yesu humng'eeda ak gwayi, “Geabadiischooweey Bwaabwa aba gideaba iissa giyiinyi gideargu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaanali gideaba iissa giileeysean iit galeagasean. Ak ghamneawa gearukuni ng'asheanji badahukeaba fiisu miinaada aba hijiin, ak abeeda gayghamwas gideaba giijeaknean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu gaguurda aba ghuuta haw, “Lasaro, Rini jarooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwardu jarooda siidida heeta meahiin, nea radaat geeshanga ea geatinga aba weageaka nea gheamamdaanyi ea sidukuta aba hang'da. Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Ootina, ak ghoanung'waadi gawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geamwaal gichea eenuusta Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu fuga saang'a bea Yahudi heeta hidu heeda Mariya iidaah gidida siniin, ghamwas niny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaweay fuga mwaatkwa heeda Farisaayajeega ak ghoadayda iita ng'asheanda sin Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin Ashoohoodiga hees sea Farisaayajeega girgweageeda nea gwayi, “Gajeesina naaha? Anda siisi iissa gwasin gwadeagwajeega saang'a muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajiidu Iisinung'waadi gwasunu gayghamwas buuneesean, ak gayghapka fuga Rumi gwanyarja hoorgeedeanya ghaydit ea eemeedeanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha siyagi siguura Gayafa was ashoohoocheanda haw gweaydida, “Agooga moanali gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agooga moanaali gideaba ghang'wana ghami siyagi aba jeedeang'wa aba badahuuka buuneeda, mwasamwa gideaba gajealas uhuuda eemeesean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siisi marukunana uhuudaanyi ng'asheesu, gwarukuna gideaba niny ashoohoocheanda haw gil aba gweaydida, niny gwaramoorsa gideaba Yesu gayghami aba badayda eemeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mii badaydeaba eemeeni gil ak ghwahit, ghabwada gideaba gagasa goonyeaschi diibiga ASEETA nigeawiit ghwadarda ak ghoah gilagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada eaweedida gagasa gheata gichea gwanuusta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eamudu gwaneayeewa Yesu bugusta fuga Yahudi nea ghabwadakta, ghabeawa hoowa ak gawa ng'eanyiida neekeewa dareapcheeda jeeda mujiineeda siguura Efraimu; ak goobiida hoowa sea ginealangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ea nineekiit Basaakeeda fuga Yahudi, gaweay fuga saang'a beawa darooraka ak gaweay Yerusalemu ghoamiidu geat nea mii ghwahidu Basaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iissa geegasa Yesu. Ak ghabwat geat aba gheeda sibata ASEETA ak goonyeari geat gideaba, “Gawuurjiin? Mayghoan jeedeaba ghweelmeeni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ea niidayda Ashoohoodiga hees ea Farisaayajeega iita gideaba siida deepa ghwanal heeda mida Yesu ea darukusiina ak abeeda geang'waay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
